allow	crates/tasty-net-topology/src/model.rs	pair[0]	hex 두 자의 첫째
allow	crates/tasty-net-topology/src/model.rs	pair[1]	hex 두 자의 둘째
allow	crates/tasty-net-topology/src/model.rs	+ 10	hex: a는 10
